              <span style="position: absolute; left: calc(50% - 0.12cqw); top: 0.97cqw; width: 0.24cqw; height: 0.45cqw; transform-origin: 50% 0; transform: translateZ(3cqw) rotateX(90deg); background: #20252e;"></span>
